00:15:02,941 --> 00:15:06,340
outlines the U.S. Air Force insignia.

268
00:15:06,341 --> 00:15:11,340
Beyond there where the chimney is was the restaurant, the bar,

269
00:15:11,341 --> 00:15:16,340
the dance floor, and Poncho's house was just beyond.

270
00:15:16,341 --> 00:15:21,340
Over beers at Poncho's, civilian test pilots and Air Force test

