00:15:41,579 --> 00:15:42,780
I think I'm more

277
00:15:42,781 --> 00:15:48,579
qualified than you Air Force youngsters. And I said, well, Mr.

278
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:52,040
May, I said, 10,000 hours of cub time

