00:15:52,041 --> 00:15:56,754
doesn't mean very much when you're flying a rocket ship or a jet.

280
00:15:56,755 --> 00:15:59,220
Poncho got a big kick out of that.

281
00:15:59,221 --> 00:16:04,960
So she said, whoever goes faster than sound first will get a free steak dinner on the house.

282
00:16:05,340 --> 00:16:09,940
On October 14, 1947, Chuck Yeager and the X-1,

