404
00:23:52,601 --> 00:23:56,600
We were more interested in the frequency that it happened, so

405
00:23:56,601 --> 00:24:01,500
So we would count 10 seconds worth of this data.

406
00:24:01,600 --> 00:24:05,840
This is a chart that I did for one of the engineers.

407
00:24:05,940 --> 00:24:10,140
This is a chart of velocity versus altitude,

408
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:16,160
and it shows the curve lines for dynamic pressure.

409
00:24:16,260 --> 00:24:18,260
Most of the women were transferred to Edwards

410
00:24:18,360 --> 00:24:21,760
