00:25:24,160 --> 00:25:26,360
The base now had to develop aircraft that could explore

432
00:25:26,460 --> 00:25:30,060
the unknown frontier beyond the Earth's atmosphere.

433
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:34,300
The budget of NASA, obviously, before 1958,

434
00:25:34,400 --> 00:25:37,300
it was principally an aeronautics budget.

435
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:42,320
After 1958, aeronautics became only the first A in NASA,

436
00:25:42,420 --> 00:25:46,720
and its budget, as you would expect, became more slender.

437
00:25:46,820 --> 00:25:49,260
The rocket-powered X-15 was the first aircraft

438
00:25:49,261 --> 00:25:53,460
explore exo-atmospheric flight, that is, outside the Earth's

439
00:25:53,461 --> 00:25:56,200
atmosphere. Roger, you've got the

