446
00:26:19,261 --> 00:26:21,060
It was a muscle airplane.

447
00:26:21,061 --> 00:26:22,660
When the engine lit, you knew it.

448
00:26:22,661 --> 00:26:27,200
It pinned you back in the seat, and you were kind of along for

449
00:26:27,201 --> 00:26:28,200
the ride.

450
00:26:28,201 --> 00:26:32,080
And acceleration due to the rocket burning got to be about

