454
00:26:45,121 --> 00:26:48,360
The last man to fly the X-15 was Bill Dana.

455
00:26:48,361 --> 00:26:51,020
We didn't go to orbit, but we went to Mach 6,

456
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:55,240
which gave us heating and stability information

457
00:26:55,241 --> 00:26:58,000
that allowed us to build the space shuttle.

458
00:26:59,580 --> 00:27:01,900
Atmospheric flight continued to be explored at Edwards

